.TH FL-DISKUSAGE 1 "November 2026" "fldesktop 0.1.4" "fldesktop"
.SH NAME
fl-diskusage \- disk usage analyser
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBfl-diskusage\fR [\fIfolder\fR]
.SH DESCRIPTION
Scans a folder (the home folder unless one is given) in the background and
draws it as a treemap: every rectangle is a file or a folder, its area its
size on disk, three levels deep. Folders are tinted in the accent colour,
files by their kind (pictures, videos, music, archives, documents).
.PP
Click a folder to show only it, \fBBackspace\fR or \fBUp\fR to go back.
The right-click menu opens a file, shows its folder in fl-files or moves it to
the trash (the sizes above it are updated). \fBWhole Disk\fR scans \fI/\fR;
folders you may not read are left out, and other file systems mounted inside
the scanned folder are not counted.
.SH KEYS
.TP
\fBCtrl+O\fR
Choose a folder.
.TP
\fBF5\fR
Scan again.
.SH SEE ALSO
\fBfl-files\fR(1), \fBfl-disks\fR(1)
